  "bio": [
    "Jack Zhang founded fintech company Airwallex in 2015 alongside Lucy Liu, Max Li, Jacob Dai and Ki Lok Wong.",
    "Offering a range of online banking functions, Airwallex facilitates cross-border payments across 130 currencies and over 180 countries, serving more than 300,000 customers worldwide.",
    "Airwallex was last valued at $11 billion in June 2026 following its $320 million Series H funding round, led by New York City-based VC firm Addition.",
    "From its origins in a coffee shop in Melbourne, Australia, the company has expanded to 27 offices globally and is now headquartered in Singapore and San Francisco.",
    "Born in Qingdao, China, Jack moved to Australia with his family when he was 16."
